                                                "sense_id": "b4ec9da3-1ea2-3eab-8349-9d79bc8c872a",
                                                "text": "All black wines, over-hot, compound, strong, thick drinks, as muscadine, malmsey, alicant, rumney, brown bastard, metheglin, and the like […]"
